# Technical Audit: Designmonk Website

## Executive Summary

This document presents technical observations and strategic recommendations for the Designmonk website, addressing SEO considerations, content strategy, and structural optimizations.

---

## Findings and Recommendations

### 1. Video Autoplay

**Finding:** Home page implements video autoplay on page load.

**Recommendation:** Disable video autoplay. Autoplay functionality negatively impacts SEO performance and degrades user experience metrics.

### 2. Submission Forms

**Finding:** Submission form functionality requires verification.

**Recommendation:** 
- Conduct thorough testing of all submission endpoints
- Document submission management procedures
- Implement error handling and confirmation workflows

### 3. Schema Markup

**Finding:** No schema markup detected on homepage or About Us page.
**Recommendation:** Implement appropriate structured data markup across all applicable pages.

### 4. Image Optimization

**Finding:** Image file naming lacks consistent convention.
**Recommendation:** Establish and enforce standardized image naming convention (e.g., `[page]-[section]-[descriptor].[ext]`).

### 5. Video Content

**Reference:** https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wh1wZeqCxd0&t=111s

**Recommendation:** Evaluate referenced content for potential replication or inspiration for original video content.

### 6. AI Claims Assessment

**Finding:** Homepage contains implicit AI-related claims without substantiation.

**Recommendation:** Clearly articulate:
- Specific AI systems in use
- Measurable outcomes derived from AI implementation
- Proprietary methodologies employed

### 7. Topical Authority

**Finding:** Site attempts to establish authority across multiple domains simultaneously (AI, branding, UX, Webflow, Framer, SaaS, development, creative direction).

**Recommendation:** Consolidate topical focus. Develop dedicated landing pages for each distinct service area:
- "How We Use AI in UX Research"
- "AI-Assisted Design Systems for SaaS"
- "Framer vs. Webflow for SaaS Startups"
- "UX Mistakes in AI Products"
- "Designing Onboarding for AI Apps"
- "Our UX Audit Framework"

### 8. Content Strategy Alignment

**Finding:** Current content optimization targets emotional response and visual engagement exclusively.

**Recommendation:** Refactor content to accommodate retrieval systems and LLM extraction. Prioritize:
- Verifiable claims with cited sources
- Quantitative data and metrics
- Structured answer formats
- Semantic clarity for chunk extraction

### 9. About Us Page

**Recommendation:**
- Implement Organization/Person schema markup
- Include team member social profile links
- Add Fahim Aziz social profile link
- Restructure FAQ section with proper heading hierarchy

### 10. Team Page

**Recommendation:**
- Embed social profile links
- Coordinate LinkedIn profile updates designating Design Monk as current employer

### 11. Sitemap Configuration

**Finding:** XML sitemap exists but lacks `<lastmod>` timestamp elements.

**Current Structure:**
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9" xmlns:xhtml="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
    <url>
        <loc>https://www.designmonks.co</loc>
    </url>
</urlset>
```

**Recommendation:** 
- Add `<lastmod>` element to each `<url>` entry reflecting the most recent modification date
- Implement ISO 8601 date format (e.g., `2026-05-06`)
- Configure automatic lastmod updates viaCMS or build process

### 12. Robots Meta Directive

**Finding:** No `<meta name="robots">` directive detected on pages.

**Recommendation:** Implement robots meta tags on single article pages:
```html
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
```

### 13. Article Metadata

**Finding:** Single article pages lack required Open Graph article meta tags.

**Missing Elements:**
```html
<meta property="article:published_time" content="2026-05-05T10:55:15Z">
<meta property="article:modified_time" content="2026-05-05T10:55:15Z">
<meta property="article:author" content="Author Name">
```

**Recommendation:** 
- Implement all article meta tags with accurate timestamps
- Assign author credentials to each article
- Configure automatic timestamp updates on content modification

### 14. EEAT and Trust Signals

**Finding:** Pages exhibit weak Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness (E-E-A-T) signals.

**Deficiencies Identified:**
- No visible expertise ownership
- No accountable human authorship
- Weak E-E-A-T implementation

**Recommendation:**
- Display author bylines prominently on all content pages
- Link author names to professional bio/profile pages
- Include author credentials and qualifications
- Implement Author schema markup
- Assign clear content ownership attribution

### 15. Breadcrumb Navigation

**Finding:** Breadcrumb implementation contains semantic errors.

**Current Structure:**
```
Blog Home > Blog details > [Page Title]
```

**Recommendation:** Refactor breadcrumb hierarchy:
```
Blog > [Article Title]
```
- Replace generic "Blog details" with descriptive article title
- Ensure consistent breadcrumb schema implementation

### 16. Category Page Indexing

**Finding:** Category pages contain no content but remain indexed.

**Affected URLs:**
- https://www.designmonk.co/projects-categories/legal-services
- Additional blank category pages (similar pattern)

**Recommendation:**
- Apply `<meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">` to all empty category pages
- Alternatively, populate category pages with meaningful content or implement proper pagination
- Remove blank category pages from XML sitemap

